{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2021-12-06 09:30:00', 'title': 'COLGATE-PALMOLIVE WEBCASTS FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE CITI GLOBAL CONSUMER CONFERENCE', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COLGATE-PALMOLIVE (NYSE:CL) CHIEF INVESTOR RELATIONS OFFICER AND SVP, M&A, JOHN FAUCHER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE CITI GLOBAL CONSUMER CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 8, 2021 AT 11:00 A.M. ET. INVESTORS MAY ACCESS A LIVE WEBCAST OF THIS FIRESIDE CHAT ON COLGATE'S WEBSITE AT WWW.COLGATEPALMOLIVE.COM. FOR THOSE UNABLE TO PARTICIPATE DURING THE LIVE WEBCAST, A RECORDED VERSION OF THE WEBCAST WILL BE MADE AVAILABLE THROUGH THE INVESTOR CENT"}